-- ½ tr K_ee′, K the gravitational factor of the magnetic and Dirac terms: −4K_ee′ = Σ_k tr(σ_k A_e) tr(σ_k A_e′) is the
-- Gram matrix of the quantized triads of edges e and e′ at the vertex
half-trace-k : List PCand → Nat → Nat → List Nat → List Triple → VW → List (List Side) → Bool × List PRad
half-trace-k cs e e1 ds ts w ss = half-trace-of cs (terms-half-trace (k-terms e e1 ds ts w (sides-nth e ss) (sides-nth e1 ss)))
